Optimize linear scans in array filtering by mapping lookup keys to a `Set` beforehand. This reduces the complexity of the lookups from O(N * M) to O(N + M) while preserving the existing classification behavior.

```suggestion
  const metricIds = new Set(dashboard.metric_definitions.map((item) => item.id));
  const missingMetricIds = REQUIRED_METRIC_IDS.filter((id) => !metricIds.has(id));
  const noClaimBoundaries = new Set(dashboard.no_claim_boundaries);
  const missingBoundaries = REQUIRED_NO_CLAIM_BOUNDARIES.filter((id) => !noClaimBoundaries.has(id));
```

